      "id": "BeneficialStrategies.Iso20022.Messages.Records",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "We have done some major architecture improvements and you're going to like it. Everything is interface-based now. You have much more flexibility than you used to have. IMPORTANT: If you want to have all the nice features, but implement the records or classes yourself, see BeneficialStrategies.Iso20022.Messages instead. It contains the interfaces you should implement and makes your own classes compatible with the rest of the tools.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "The entirety of the ISO20022 message domain model. 2,665 B2B financial messages structured as immutable records based on the ISO20022 standard.",
